  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The leading vision-language pathology foundation model — 86k+ monthly HuggingFace downloads, Nature Medicine 2024, state-of-the-art across 14 tasks, trained on PMC open-access image-caption pairs (unlike PLIP's Twitter data). Assess rather than Adopt due to CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0 licence: non-commercial and no-derivatives restrictions. Complements UNI in the MACH catalog: UNI is the vision-only encoder; CONCH adds language understanding for zero-shot and retrieval tasks.",
